<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Jefferies alters energy firms.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Jefferies alters energy firms.</headline>
<text>
<p>- Jefferies &amp; Co analyst C Van Levy has altered his ratings on several energy companies.</p>
<p>- Upgrades Seagull Energy Corp to accumulate from holf.</p>
<p>- Downgrades Stone Energy Corp to accumulate from buy.</p>
<p>- Rates Tom Brown Inc buy after its removal from the restricted list following Presidio Oil acquisition.</p>
<p>- Downgrades Comstock Resources to accumulate from buy.</p>
<p>- Downgrades Vintage Petroleum Inc to accumulate from buy.</p>
<p>Van Levy was not immediately available to comment. ((-- New York Newsroom 212 859 1902))</p>
</text>
